{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act21side_level_act21side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act21side",
  "stageId": "act21side_06",
  "title": "Old Conflicts",
  "storyCode": "IS-6",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bde7922acca4c5750818f630288ca4263fd04ef3f1e2d96f89e52e78497c6d50",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Urgh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Signor, are you alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Just dreaming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's why you shouldn't sleep on the sofa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where's the old man?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Don went to the theater."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Leontuzzo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you going too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Leontuzzo does not answer, only sinking deeper into the sofa."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rossati, Giovanna."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_685_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_685_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Cellinia, our original agreement was to ensure the Bellones come out on top."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_685_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, I've changed my mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_685_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "As long as you succeed, you don't owe us anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_685_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At that point, you're free to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bernardo",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_685_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This, I promise you as the Fang of Zaaro, il Signore dei Lupi."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tsk, tsk. The sun's still getting in my eyes, even though it's raining."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Prison food's not too bad. You should give it a try."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loyal Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're right about that. I've even given 'em a few suggestions before."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loyal Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Now get in the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can I sit this one out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does killing a single Columbian really deserve so much fanfare?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loyal Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Don says Cellinia's gonna be there too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What's the plan?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loyal Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She'll pretend to be an actress, and once the performance starts, you'll improvise the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmm... So what about my costume?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loyal Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What the Don meant was—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loyal Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You wait in the audience and play along."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, right. Haha."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What an insensitive old jerk. So where's he gonna be? He's not trying to find a nice place to watch the show all by himself, is he?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loyal Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The Don has other business. He's got a meeting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lappland",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_683_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "A meeting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Loyal Mafioso",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, with a carwash worker."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Howdy, Sora. I just knew you'd be practicin' in Miss Caterina's studio."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I ain't gonna stop ya, but don'tha think you oughta head to the theater early? To do some makeup n' get ready n' whatnot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Yeah, you have a point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Exusiai's already off to buy breakfast. We got just enough time to meet her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#14$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Say... Didn't we say we'd set up a big ol' welcome for Exusiai's sister?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "We did."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "But now I'm not sure we'll have enough time for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Croissant, watch your step!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? Wooooah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Owwie..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Are you alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm fine, I'm fine. Just tripped on a little somethin'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dangit, I knocked over that stack of books. Lemme tidy 'em up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? A picture dropped outta somethin'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Picture?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#13$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wait... Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "What's wrong?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#15$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Lookie here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It is a photograph from many years ago.\nSora can barely make out the background that should be of the wide and bustling streets of Columbia past.\nIn the center of the photograph stands a middle-aged man who wears a kind expression, but exudes an audacity not to be trifled with.\nOn his left and right sides stand a Lupo girl, and a Feline girl.\nThe girl on the left has beautiful blonde hair and sports a cheery expression, and even at a glance, one can immediately tell that she has a bubbly personality.\nThe girl on the right has black hair, her face betraying no emotions, making it difficult for one to guess the contents of her heart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#15$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look, this pitcher... ain't that... Texas, as a kid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And standin' there with her... That's Caterina?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And look on the back here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Written on the backside of the photo: 'Giovanna and Cellinia, 1080.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerToken": "avg_201_moeshd_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Giovanna... Is that gonna be Caterina's real name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerToken": "char_101_sora_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_101_sora",
      "portraitKey": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "Giovanna... Giovanna Rossati."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How long has this carwash been open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Five years."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Five years? Coincidentally, that's how long my guard tuskbeast has been missing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If only I knew how he was doing these days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The city's a pretty big place. There's always a way to survive."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It never made any sense to me before. I fed him plenty of meat, gave him a nice den. Why wasn't he happy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Think he might've been vegetarian?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe. Maybe it never knew how bad meat actually was until it tried a full-course meal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_693_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's better to not eat at all... than to eat something bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_693_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your car's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're pretty good at your job."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_693_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Practice makes perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heh. You never fail to get it done just right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, Danbrown, nothing lasts forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's time for you to change your tastes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carwash Worker",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_693_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I'll think about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alberto",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_686_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Think carefully. Once you've figured it out, you're always welcome to come back."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Makeup Artist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you the backup bassist?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Makeup Artist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, um... Is that your natural hair color?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Makeup Artist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's special. Usually, you have to dye your hair to work as a bassist. I've heard only those with Famiglia Texas blood have that eye and hair color."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Makeup Artist",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And, now that I'm seeing you up close, your eyebrows... look really similar to Salvadore's. Are you his bastard or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerToken": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
